/*!
    \qmlmodule MaterialRally
    \title Material Rally QML Types
    \brief Material Rally QML Types
    \ingroup qmlmodules

    You can import this module using the following statement:

    \code
    import MaterialRally as Rally
    \endcode

    \note
    You should import the Material Rally QML module into its own namespace (e.g. Rally) because it uses the same names as the official Qt Quick Controls.
    Thus you can use both besides each other: the official Quick Controls and the Material Rally Controls.

    \section1 QML Types
    \generatelist {qmltypesbymodule MaterialRally}
    \noautolist
*/
